<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44989" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐρύ̆-βᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wide-stepping</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					184
				</span></i>
			, with a play on <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>spacious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				2.283
			</span></i> (
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλίβ</span>
			-), <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				28.79
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> pr. n.
				(later-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">της</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.20
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>), a proverbial cheat, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				327d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.137
			</span></i>; the betrayer of Croesus, <i><span class="en">
				Ephor.
				58
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				9.32
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐρῠ-βᾰτεύομαι</span></b> , <i>cheat like Eurybatus</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diogenian.
				4.76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
